      errorSystemMessage: 
      userPrompt: "Create a 2.5D slingshot setup at (0, -2, 0):\n1. Create an empty
        GameObject named 'SlingshotManager' at (0, -2, 0).\n2. Attach a LineRenderer
        to 'SlingshotManager' with 20 positions, start width 0.15, end width 0.05,
        and a default unlit material.\n3. Under 'SlingshotManager', create a child
        GameObject named 'WordProjectile' with:\n   - A SphereCollider (radius 0.6)\n  
        - A Rigidbody with Interpolation enabled, Collision Detection set to Continuous,
        and Constraints freezing Position Z, Rotation X, and Rotation Y.\n4. Under
        'WordProjectile', add a 3D TextMeshPro object centered at (0,0,0) with text
        \"DAWN\", bold font, auto-sizing enabled, center alignment, and facing the
        camera (+Z forward)."
      TicketPrompt: "Create a 2.5D slingshot setup at (0, -2, 0):\n1. Create an empty
        GameObject named 'SlingshotManager' at (0, -2, 0).\n2. Attach a LineRenderer
        to 'SlingshotManager' with 20 positions, start width 0.15, end width 0.05,
        and a default unlit material.\n3. Under 'SlingshotManager', create a child
        GameObject named 'WordProjectile' with:\n   - A SphereCollider (radius 0.6)\n  
        - A Rigidbody with Interpolation enabled, Collision Detection set to Continuous,
        and Constraints freezing Position Z, Rotation X, and Rotation Y.\n4. Under
        'WordProjectile', add a 3D TextMeshPro object centered at (0,0,0) with text
        \"DAWN\", bold font, auto-sizing enabled, center alignment, and facing the
        camera (+Z forward)."
      ChatResponses:
        Answers:
        - Content: "Created the 2.5D slingshot setup at `(0, -2, 0)` with a configurable
            launch line, constrained physics projectile, and centered \u201CDAWN\u201D
            TextMeshPro display.\n\n## Changes made\n\n- **Slingshot manager:** Added
            `SlingshotManager` with a 20-position `LineRenderer`, tapered widths
            from `0.15` to `0.05`, and a default unlit material.\n- **Projectile:**
            Added the `WordProjectile` child with a sphere collider using radius
            `0.6` and a Rigidbody configured for interpolation, continuous collision
            detection, and locked Z movement with X/Y rotation frozen.\n- **Text
            display:** Added centered, bold, auto-sized 3D TextMeshPro text reading
            **\u201CDAWN\u201D**, oriented toward the camera along +Z.\n- **Slingshot
            behavior:** Implemented aiming and release behavior. The line stayed
            anchored to the manager, followed the pulled projectile, and launched
            it along a ballistic arc before retracting smoothly."
