          - Id: gi5LP
            Name: "Determine how SimpleWordChooser runs rounds, identifies corr\u2026"
            State: 1
            Status: 0
            StopReason: 
            OriginTask: Determine how SimpleWordChooser runs rounds, identifies correct
              selections, updates score, and the cleanest event/callback point for
              a separate sunrise lighting system to react exactly once to each correct
              choice.
            CrawlCount: 2
